---
import BaseLayout from '../layouts/BaseLayout.astro';
---

<BaseLayout
  title="Permits & License | Chillax Creek"
  description="Short-term rental permits and licensing information for Chillax Creek in Fannin County, Georgia."
>
  <section class="home-sec1" style="padding-top: 60px;">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
          <h6 class="red-heading">Compliant short-term rental</h6>
          <h2>Permits &amp; License</h2>
          <p>
            Chillax Creek operates as a fully permitted and licensed short-term rental in Fannin
            County, Georgia. Below is an overview of the registrations and compliance items that
            keep us in good standing — and keep our guests protected.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>

  <section class="home-sec4">
    <div class="container">
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Short-Term Rental Permit</h4>
          <p>
            We hold an active short-term rental permit issued by Fannin County, Georgia. The
            permit is renewed annually and is on file with the local jurisdiction.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Lodging Tax Registration</h4>
          <p>
            Chillax Creek is registered to collect and remit Georgia state sales tax and Fannin
            County hotel-motel (lodging) tax on all qualifying stays. These are passed through
            transparently in your booking.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Business License</h4>
          <p>
            The property is operated by a registered Georgia business entity. Tax ID and business
            license details are available on request.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Insurance</h4>
          <p>
            We maintain commercial short-term-rental insurance covering both property and liability.
            Booking platforms (Airbnb, Vrbo) provide additional Host Protection coverage for
            those reservations.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Safety Inspections</h4>
          <p>
            Smoke alarms, carbon monoxide detectors, and fire extinguishers are tested on a regular
            schedule. A first aid kit is located in the kitchen. Emergency contact info is posted in
            the cabin.
          </p>
        </div>
        <div class="col-lg-6 col-md-6 mb-4">
          <h4 style="color: #B40000; font-weight: 600;">Privacy & Cameras</h4>
          <p>
            Exterior security cameras are present on the property (driveway and main entry).
            <strong>No cameras of any kind exist inside the cabin or in any private outdoor area</strong>
            (hot tub, fire pit, balconies). See our <a href="/privacy-policy/">privacy policy</a>
            for details.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
      <div class="row">
        <div class="col-lg-12">
          <p style="margin-top: 20px;">
            Need our specific permit or license number for a corporate booking, insurance claim, or
            tax form? <a href="/contact-us/">Get in touch</a> and we&rsquo;ll send it over.
          </p>
        </div>
      </div>
    </div>
  </section>
</BaseLayout>
